      "created_at": "2021-09-04T06:38:52Z",
      "updated_at": "2021-09-04T06:38:52Z",
      "body": "This is not possible at the moment and would need updates to core to implement this.\n\nThere is a hack/workaround that may help you: the hide parent post trick.\n\nCreate a post, \nreply to it with he content and tagging the people you want to see it, \nthen hide the parent. \n\nOf course the replies will still be in the open blockchain - but they wont show on bitclout.com\n",
      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "pin": null,
