      "updated_at": "2021-09-04T11:10:53Z",
      "body": "That is an interesting hack thanks.\r\n\r\nSo this social product is replacing Twitter, not Facebook then as it seems to focus on public discourse instead of smaller private groups.\r\n\r\nHas anyone solved the GDPR issues yet of blockchain products? If my app allows users to store PII on bitclout's chain, is it enough to mark it as 'hidden' from a legal perspective?",
      "author_association": "NONE",
      "pin": null,
      "reactions": {
