      "created_at": "2021-09-04T12:05:42Z",
      "updated_at": "2021-09-04T12:05:42Z",
      "body": "You would need to get your own legal advice on that. Im not sure what the position is. \n\nNote that GDPR is mainly about personal identifiable info like phone, email, ID etc.\n\nAs these are not on chain - its definitely a node decision rather then a bitclout one.\n\nThe harder one i suspect is the right to be forgotten stuff in the EU. \n\nNo idea how that would interpret a blockchain",
      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "pin": null,
